  gateId: S10_Pattern
  description: "MCQ: A. Current increases as potential difference increases. \xB7
    B. Current decreases. \xB7 C. There is no pattern. (correct A) \u2192 LearnerSession.s10PatternAnswer.
    Wrong: S10_R_WRONG then re-ask; second wrong: sweep V then I column, re-ask;
    third answer accepted."
